<div class="titlepage"><div><div><h2 class="title" style="clear: both">
<a name="zend.barcode.introduction"></a>16.1. Introduction</h2></div></div></div>
<p>
        <code class="classname">Zend_Barcode</code> provides a generic way to generate barcodes. The
        <code class="classname">Zend_Barcode</code> component is divided into two subcomponents: barcode
        objects and renderers. Objects allow you to create barcodes independently of the
        renderer. Renderer allow you to draw barcodes based on the support required.
    </p>
